  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Mix soups, onion soup mix and Worchestershire Sauce in a deep stew kettle or crock pot.",
      "group": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Add stew meat (no need to brown fist but it’s okay if you do), potatoes, carrots, peas and mushrooms.",
      "group": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and bake at 250 degrees for 4 hours. If using crock pot, cook on high for 1 hour and then turn to low and cook for 4 to 5 hours more).",
      "group": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir once or twice during cooking. If stew is too thick, add 8 oz. beef broth or 2 beef bullion cubes in one cup hot water.",
      "group": null
    },
    {
      "text": "This recipe is very forgiving and always turns out great!",
      "group": null
    }
  ],
